279
00:22:42,680 --> 00:22:43,560
Parn.

280
00:22:45,880 --> 00:22:46,800
Oh.

281
00:22:46,960 --> 00:22:48,600
Uh, hello.

282
00:22:48,840 --> 00:22:49,960
How is Ms. Peem doing?

283
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:51,240
Parn really wants to go see her

284
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:53,560
but she's afraid that
Ms. Peem's father will scold her.

285
00:22:55,400 --> 00:22:57,720
It's fine. Just tell him honestly.

286
00:22:58,040 --> 00:22:59,120
Maybe he can help

287
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:16,160
You took so long.

288
00:23:20,320 --> 00:23:21,240
Peem.

289
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:26,880
Parn.

290
00:23:36,320 --> 00:23:37,640
I miss you, Peem.

291
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:41,440
I miss you too, Parn.

292
00:23:42,720 --> 00:23:44,440
I miss you so much.

293
00:23:49,280 --> 00:23:53,400
I know I can't
be with you.

294
00:23:53,960 --> 00:23:56,840
