335
00:26:30,560 --> 00:26:31,600
You're right.

336
00:26:33,640 --> 00:26:34,600
Shit!

337
00:26:40,840 --> 00:26:42,400
You changed your mind?

338
00:26:42,600 --> 00:26:43,680
My ass!

339
00:26:43,680 --> 00:26:47,240
Peem's dad is here. If you don't go now,
you'll die before you find your husband.

340
00:26:48,320 --> 00:26:49,280
Huh?

341
00:26:52,520 --> 00:26:55,240
Split up! Split up! Split up!

342
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:56,640
Come on, get up!

343
00:26:58,080 --> 00:26:59,360
Your dad is here.

344
00:26:59,360 --> 00:27:01,680
- Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up.
- Put on your shoes.

345
00:27:02,720 --> 00:27:04,360
- Come here.
- Bye-bye.

346
00:27:05,240 --> 00:27:07,160
Don't worry about her. Worry about yourself.

347
00:27:26,840 --> 00:27:29,680
Oh, Dad. You're back so soon, just like you said.

348
00:27:33,680 --> 00:27:35,080
So, how is she?

349
00:27:35,080 --> 00:27:36,560
Oh, she already ate.

350
00:27:36,560 --> 00:27:39,240
And I bought her a cup of coffee too.
She wasn't stubborn at all.

351
