Hey.

352
00:27:49,200 --> 00:27:51,400
Jeez! That was close.

353
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,880
That was very close.

354
00:27:55,480 --> 00:27:57,680
But it's good that you got to see her.

355
00:27:57,680 --> 00:27:58,880
I'm so happy.

356
00:28:01,280 --> 00:28:02,120
What?

357
00:28:02,840 --> 00:28:03,880
What's wrong?

358
00:28:04,880 --> 00:28:06,720
I think I shouldn't see Peem anymore.

359
00:28:08,120 --> 00:28:09,320
You do?

360
00:28:09,960 --> 00:28:10,920
Yeah.

361
00:28:11,480 --> 00:28:13,480
I don't want her
to have a problem with her father.

362
00:28:26,280 --> 00:28:27,880
It's late. Why are you still up?

363
00:28:33,160 --> 00:28:34,680
I need to talk to you about something.

364
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:42,560
I heard that you told Parn to get out of my life.

365
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:44,680
Why did you do that?

366
00:28:45,720 --> 00:28:46,960
Because I mean well.

367
00:28:47,720 --> 00:28:49,040
How is that meaning well?

368
00:28:49,760 --> 00:28:50,920
I love Parn.

369
00:28:51,600 --> 00:28:54,360
Parn is the most precious thing in my life.

370
00:28:54,600 --> 00:28:57,200
And you told her to cut her ties with me?

371
00:28:58,400 --> 00:28:59,640
I did it for you.

372
00:28:59,640 --> 00:29:01,120
What do you mean you did it for me?

373
00:29:01,760 --> 00:29:03,080
We've talked about this.

374
00:29:03,280 --> 00:29:06,640
You won’t be able to handle the pressure
and people looking down on you.

375
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:08,880
And there's this whole mess too.

376
00:29:08,880 --> 00:29:10,560
She got you hurt.

377
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:12,400
You almost died, Peem.

378
00:29:12,680 --> 00:29:14,440
Have you ever asked me?

379
00:29:15,200 --> 00:29:16,680
You just made up your own mind.

380
00:29:17,680 --> 00:29:20,400
And about her job, you can forget it.

381
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:23,840
Because I don't care what she used to do.

382
00:29:25,080 --> 00:29:26,640
I love Parn.

383
00:29:27,560 --> 00:29:29,240
And the reason I went to help her

384
00:29:30,440 --> 00:29:32,560
was because she's my life.

385
00:29:32,560 --> 00:29:34,480
She's the air I breathe.

386
00:29:36,800 --> 00:29:38,320
I beg you, Dad.

387
00:29:39,800 --> 00:29:42,400
Even though you forbid Parn from contacting me,

388
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:45,600
