389
00:29:48,800 --> 00:29:50,160
Just like you.

390
00:29:53,240 --> 00:29:54,600
I'm a daughter of a whore.

391
00:29:55,640 --> 00:29:58,320
Still, no one can make you stop loving me.

392
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:04,640
Dad.

393
00:30:08,360 --> 00:30:09,600
Do you love me?

394
00:30:16,960 --> 00:30:18,160
Of course, I love you.

395
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:20,080
I love you more than anything in the world.

396
00:30:20,920 --> 00:30:23,720
You're the only one who loves me.

397
00:30:25,800 --> 00:30:27,880
Mm? Everyone loves you, sweetheart.

398
00:30:28,760 --> 00:30:30,600
They don't love me.

399
00:30:30,600 --> 00:30:33,200
They say my mom is bad.

400
00:30:39,960 --> 00:30:41,880
It’s okay if others don’t love you.

401
00:30:43,240 --> 00:30:44,960
I love you the most.

402
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:51,400
And I will always protect you and take care of you

403
00:30:52,120 --> 00:30:54,280
