404
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:57,040
It's okay, sweetheart.

405
00:31:21,600 --> 00:31:22,680
Hello.

406
00:31:23,920 --> 00:31:25,960
Do you need something from me, Mr. Phakpoom?

407
00:31:28,920 --> 00:31:30,800
Peem has woken up. She's safe.

408
00:31:37,520 --> 00:31:40,920
Look, I only wanted to protect my daughter.

409
00:31:42,480 --> 00:31:44,520
Keeping you away from Peem

410
00:31:44,960 --> 00:31:47,720
