411
00:31:54,760 --> 00:31:57,600
But I didn't consider Peem's feelings.

412
00:32:05,160 --> 00:32:07,440
I came here today to ask you for something.

413
00:32:11,120 --> 00:32:15,560
I'm sorry for forcing you out of Peem's life.

414
00:32:19,040 --> 00:32:20,880
Can you go back to her?

415
00:32:24,640 --> 00:32:26,800
Go back and be her happiness again.

416
00:32:29,520 --> 00:32:31,640
Peem is like my whole world.

417
00:32:33,600 --> 00:32:34,760
And you

418
00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:37,840
