419
00:32:47,840 --> 00:32:49,960
Hey, when are you going back to work?

420
00:32:50,960 --> 00:32:52,480
Stop asking that like my dad.

421
00:32:52,480 --> 00:32:53,840
Ugh, this girl!

422
00:32:53,840 --> 00:32:56,320
I'm basically your godfather.

423
00:32:59,040 --> 00:33:00,440
I'll put these things away in your room.

424
00:33:12,200 --> 00:33:14,680
Hey, I've put those away in your room.

425
00:33:14,680 --> 00:33:16,640
If there's nothing else, I'll get going.

426
00:33:16,640 --> 00:33:18,120
