430
00:33:28,480 --> 00:33:30,280
Alright, go.

431
00:33:32,520 --> 00:33:33,960
Thanks for picking me up.

432
00:33:34,160 --> 00:33:35,240
Let's grab something to eat later.

433
00:33:36,360 --> 00:33:37,120
Okay.

434
