461
00:35:56,760 --> 00:36:01,480
♪ I'm in love, there's something about you ♪

462
00:36:01,480 --> 00:36:08,320
♪ I wish you were mine, oh ♪

463
00:36:08,720 --> 00:36:10,840
♪ There's something about you ♪

464
00:36:11,160 --> 00:36:13,240
♪ I wish you were mine ♪

465
00:36:13,440 --> 00:36:14,440
How did you get here?

466
00:36:15,840 --> 00:36:17,800
You dad came to see me at the shop.

467
00:36:20,080 --> 00:36:21,160
To ask me.

468
00:36:23,120 --> 00:36:24,520
To break up with me?

469
00:36:25,240 --> 00:36:26,200
No.

470
00:36:28,440 --> 00:36:30,160
To come back to you.

471
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:39,560
I never thought that someone like him
would plead with anyone.

472
00:36:42,320 --> 00:36:44,360
When he was sitting there in front of me,

473
00:36:46,360 --> 00:36:49,000
he wasn't the billionaire businessman I'd met.

474
00:36:50,680 --> 00:36:52,360
He's just a father

475
00:36:53,280 --> 00:36:55,640
who's willing to do anything
for his child’s happiness.

476
00:36:59,000 --> 00:37:01,040
I've never seen my dad like that

477
00:37:03,040 --> 00:37:05,040
He never backs down to anyone.

478
00:37:12,840 --> 00:37:14,480
Your dad said

479
00:37:14,920 --> 00:37:17,000
it's because you're his whole world.

480
00:37:20,600 --> 00:37:22,880
And I also don't want to lose you again.

481
00:37:38,240 --> 00:37:39,360
So this time,

482
00:37:43,600 --> 00:37:45,480
