483
00:37:46,560 --> 00:37:47,640
I won't run away.

484
00:38:16,560 --> 00:38:17,960
Are you sure about your decision?

485
00:38:18,560 --> 00:38:19,480
Yes.

486
00:38:32,600 --> 00:38:36,520
I was expecting you to come
to talk to me about this,

487
00:38:37,200 --> 00:38:38,600
