488
00:39:00,040 --> 00:39:03,520
You’ve been smiling a lot more
since Parn started living with you.

489
00:39:15,800 --> 00:39:16,960
Thank you, Dad.

490
00:39:19,080 --> 00:39:21,600
Get David’s contract sorted out.

491
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:24,360
Then you can go on vacation.

492
00:40:01,680 --> 00:40:02,640
Hello.

493
00:40:04,800 --> 00:40:05,840
Hello, Ms. Peem.

494
00:40:47,520 --> 00:40:49,160
It’s a pleasure to be working with you.

495
00:40:51,600 --> 00:40:52,800
Likewise.

496
00:40:53,160 --> 00:40:55,840
