500
00:41:32,440 --> 00:41:36,600
Being competitors doesn’t mean
you can’t wish each other well.

501
00:41:37,720 --> 00:41:40,000
But we're partners now.

502
00:41:40,600 --> 00:41:41,800
Yes.

503
00:41:42,240 --> 00:41:43,880
Let's have a meal together sometime.

504
00:41:44,080 --> 00:41:45,000
Invite Parn too.

505
00:41:45,480 --> 00:41:48,160
And when you make it official with Parn,

506
00:41:50,720 --> 00:41:52,040
I will...

507
00:41:56,480 --> 00:41:58,600
I will introduce David to my family too.

508
00:41:59,320 --> 00:42:00,280
Really?

509
00:42:00,640 --> 00:42:01,520
Yeah.

510
00:42:02,240 --> 00:42:03,360
Let's give it a try.

511
00:42:07,400 --> 00:42:08,680
We'll get going, then.

512
00:42:09,280 --> 00:42:10,120
Good luck.

513
00:42:35,960 --> 00:42:37,000
You're done?

514
00:42:37,800 --> 00:42:38,880
I'm done.

515
00:42:44,640 --> 00:42:48,320
Today, I closed a deal with the investor
for the biggest project in my life.

516
00:42:51,880 --> 00:42:53,720
I knew you could do it.

517
00:42:59,600 --> 00:43:01,160
There's something more important,

518
00:43:02,320 --> 00:43:03,560
but I haven't done it yet.

519
00:43:04,280 --> 00:43:05,320
What is it?

520
00:43:12,920 --> 00:43:16,200
Closing the deal with the woman who'll join me
on my journey for the rest of my life.

521
00:43:19,120 --> 00:43:20,120
Me?

522
00:43:20,440 --> 00:43:21,520
Of course, it's you.

523
00:43:22,960 --> 00:43:24,480
It can never be anyone else.

524
00:43:29,600 --> 00:43:31,000
Will you marry me?

525
00:43:32,840 --> 00:43:34,160
Be mine alone.

526
00:43:51,280 --> 00:43:53,080
From now on, if anyone asks,

527
00:43:53,920 --> 00:43:55,480
tell them you're my wife.

528
00:43:55,920 --> 00:43:57,200
Understand?

529
00:44:07,560 --> 00:44:08,360
Yes.

530
00:44:09,600 --> 00:44:11,560
I'm your wife alone.

531
00:44:12,600 --> 00:44:21,960
♪ Will there ever be a day
That I'm brave enough to say the word? ♪

532
00:44:22,640 --> 00:44:31,720
♪ The truth is, I love you with all my heart ♪

533
00:44:41,720 --> 00:44:45,080
♪ Just the one word, love ♪

534
00:44:45,080 --> 00:44:50,520
♪ I don't understand why I can't say it ♪

535
00:44:51,160 --> 00:44:53,960
♪ Why do I keep it to myself? ♪

536
00:44:54,720 --> 00:45:00,960
♪ I can only be angry with myself
For acting so cold ♪

537
00:45:01,240 --> 00:45:06,040
♪ Making something so simple so complicated ♪

538
00:45:11,760 --> 00:45:15,080
If you are happy,
keep that happiness for yourself.

539
00:45:15,960 --> 00:45:19,840
But if you are suffering, please share it with me.

540
00:45:21,120 --> 00:45:23,600
No matter how our story turns out,

541
00:45:24,560 --> 00:45:27,040
I want you to know that you are not alone.

542
00:45:29,080 --> 00:45:31,760
I will always support you and cheer you on.

543
00:45:33,400 --> 00:45:36,200
Don’t be afraid to leave the past behind
and move forward together.

544
00:45:36,720 --> 00:45:38,360
From now on and forever.

545
00:45:54,600 --> 00:46:01,400
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

546
00:46:01,680 --> 00:46:06,680
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

547
00:46:06,840 --> 00:46:09,560
♪ I don't understand ♪

548
00:46:09,560 --> 00:46:10,360
THE END

